      "name": "Council of Three",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Three briar lords can undergo a 1-hour ritual to become a council of three. While within 60 feet of two other members of its council that don't have the Incapacitated condition, the briar lord has proficiency in all saving throws, as well as access to its Exchanging Strikes action and Slice as One reaction.</p><p>Award a party an additional 4,100 XP (5,900 XP total) for defeating the briar lord while it is within 60 feet of two other members of its council that don't have the Incapacitated condition.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
